bviz bundles and derives from the third-party work listed here. Each entry
gives what the work is, where it came from, and which licence declaration
records its terms. Every declaration names an SPDX kind and the text it
governs, so this file adds only what a declaration cannot state: which part of
bviz a work reached, and how. None of the terms below are bviz's own.

LICENSES/ declares the terms of work bviz carries in its own tree, and holds
their text unless the same text arrives with other work Bazel fetches, as
Bazel's own licence does. Work Bazel fetches arrives with its own text, and its
declaration points there.

